## Getting Started

```bash
# Clone
git clone https://github.com/dtj-standard/dtj.git
cd dtj

# Build core
cargo build --release --package dtj

# Run CLI
./target/release/dtj --help

# Run tests
cargo test
```

## Independence Goals

This project is intentionally decoupled from:
- Doc Hub paid packs
- Doc Hub extension manifests
- Doc Hub-specific licensing
- Doc Hub internal workflows
- Commercial cloud telemetry
- Any single-platform dependencies

All components are designed to be:
- Language-neutral where possible
- Standalone buildable
- Licensed under permissive Open Source licenses
- Functionally complete for local-first debug trace use cases
```